    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's helpful. I'm concerned about the potential for intermittent brake fade or sudden changes in pedal feel during sustained heavy braking. Can you explain why a system might suddenly start acting up or behaving unpredictably even when the thermal data seems within spec?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
